column101:
Github user dain commented on a diff in the pull request:

    https://github.com/apache/zookeeper/pull/184#discussion_r195534358

    --- Diff: src/java/main/org/apache/zookeeper/common/X509Util.java ---
    @@ -79,7 +91,7 @@
